{ Level 8 : tricks and traps
What would be an essay about opening without mention of the TRAPS ? }
14... Qa5 { Not that good but setting a very vicious trap only Dragon players know } 15. Nd5 Qxd2 16. Nxe7+ { White must be happy at that point to play that pretty (but famous in sicilian in general) intermediate move } 16... Kh8 17. Rxd2 (17. Bxd2 Rxd4 $19) 17... Re8 18. Nd5 { Only safe square for the knight } 18... Nxd5 19. exd5 Rxe3 $19 *

