{ I hope you will from now on have a better perspective on what is required to reach an expert level on an opening.

It's not only a matter of theory, it's a whole. Your goal is to like what you play, to understand what you play and to know what you play.
If I had to pick one, it would be the comprehension. You won't go anywhere without a good understanding of your opening mechanics.

This might sound a little excessive but don't worry ! You have plenty of time, and there is an almost infinite number of good resources to gather that precious knowledge. Even more in 2023 ! }
 *
